  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification and planning of the next partnershipproject between KFS Denmark and EUS Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It&#x2019;s almost three years ago KFS and EUS had to end our last project early due to the COVID-19 pandemic. Since then, the partnership has been kept to a minimum. With the proposed preparatory study KFS and EUS whish to restart the cooperation once again. The goal is two-fold. First and foremost, the study should help determine what the most relevant focus of the next project would be. And the study should help jump-start applicationpreparation process. Secondly the study should help anchoring the project (as well as potential future ones) in the newly formed project group.</narrative>
  </description>
